1
00:00:00,415 --> 00:00:02,125
(Howard:)Then what's with the disinfectant?

2
00:00:02,333 --> 00:00:04,673
(Sheldon:)I know where my feet have been.

3
00:00:09,132 --> 00:00:10,512
(Stuart:)Hey, Penny.

4
00:00:10,842 --> 00:00:11,922
(Stuart:)And you guys.

5
00:00:13,803 --> 00:00:16,683
(Stuart:)Albino Bob couldn't make it,
so I brought a substitute.

6
00:00:16,848 --> 00:00:20,808
(Stuart:)I believe some of you
know Wil Wheaton.

7
00:00:23,729 --> 00:00:25,269
(Wil:)Hi, Sheldon. How's it going?

8
00:00:25,481 --> 00:00:29,531
(Sheldon:)Well, well, well,
if it isn't Wil Wheaton.

9
00:00:29,694 --> 00:00:32,024
(Sheldon:)The Green Goblin to my Spider-Man.

10
00:00:32,196 --> 00:00:34,486
The Pope Paul V to my Galileo.

11
00:00:34,657 --> 00:00:37,787
(Sheldon:)The Internet Explorer to my Firefox.

12
00:00:38,411 --> 00:00:42,201
Not carrying a grudge because I beat you
at that card tournament, are you?

13
00:00:42,373 --> 00:00:45,083
(Sheldon:)I'm the proud owner
of Wil-Wheaton-stinks.com...

14
00:00:45,293 --> 00:00:47,543
...dot-net and dot-org.
What does that tell you?

15
00:00:47,753 --> 00:00:51,173
(Wil:)It tells me that I am living rent-free
right here.

16
00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:55,050
(Wil:)-You ready to bowl?
-Oh, I'm ready.

17
00:00:55,219 --> 00:00:58,059
(Sheldon:)I don't know if Stuart told you
what you're up against...

18
00:00:58,222 --> 00:01:02,062
(Sheldon:)...but before you stands the co-captain
of the East Texas Christian Youth...

